{
  "id": "reflexive-verbs-1",
  "level": "A2",
  "title": "Reflexivverben 1",
  "group": "Verbs",
  "sourceFile": "reflexiv1.html",
  "overviewSource": "reflexexpl.html",
  "overview": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "Reflexive verbs use a reflexive pronoun (mich, dich, sich…) that refers back to the subject. Many daily-routine verbs are reflexive."
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "content": "sich waschen — to wash (oneself)\nsich anziehen — to get dressed\nsich freuen — to be glad\nsich interessieren — to be interested"
      },
      {
        "type": "example",
        "de": "Ich wasche mich. / Du wäschst dich.",
        "note": "reflexive pronoun matches subject"
      }
    ]
  },
